{
  "title": "Airwindows",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "The Airwindows",
        "collection by Chris",
        "Johnson: 519 audio",
        "effects, bundled and",
        "ready to use.",
        "",
        "No download or setup",
        "is needed. Add it to",
        "a Signal Chain and",
        "pick an effect.",
        "",
        "It is also a general",
        "CLAP host, so extra",
        ".clap files you add",
        "are discovered too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Browsing",
      "lines": [
        "Effects are grouped",
        "into 22 categories",
        "(Ambience, Amp Sims,",
        "Consoles, Dynamics,",
        "Reverb, Saturation,",
        "Tape and more).",
        "",
        "Use 'Jump to",
        "Category' on the",
        "root page to pick a",
        "category, then step",
        "through the effects",
        "in it.",
        "",
        "Categories come from",
        "the plugins found,",
        "so adding your own",
        "adds to the list."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Extra plugins",
      "lines": [
        "Optional. Copy your",
        "own .clap files into",
        "the module's plugins",
        "folder using the",
        "Schwung manager at",
        "move.local:7700.",
        "",
        "They must be built",
        "for ARM64 Linux",
        "(aarch64).",
        "",
        "Only plugins with an",
        "audio input appear",
        "in the browser."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Controls",
      "lines": [
        "The 8 knobs are",
        "mapped to the first",
        "8 parameters of the",
        "effect you loaded,",
        "in the order the",
        "effect reports them.",
        "",
        "Effects with fewer",
        "parameters leave",
        "the rest unused.",
        "",
        "Names and ranges",
        "come from the",
        "effect itself."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
